      {
        "number": 10,
        "internalPageId": 10,
        "title": "Language Targets",
        "visibleTexts": [
          "Language Targets",
          "Functions Examples 1 Actions happening in the past interrupted by another one. I was having breakfast when all started to move. 2 Actions happening simultaneously in the past. John was screaming while I was pulling him back into the house.",
          "When using past progressive we can consider two main functions about actions happening in the past.",
          "TO CONSIDER Both use the same structure but the difference is given by the connector."
        ],
